  dialogueText: {fileID: 3581749421994119249}
  continueButton: {fileID: 2862431364421156978}
  storyController: {fileID: 0}
  stage0Lines:
  - 'You''re back. Good.

    This place isn''t a cafe, it''s a hideout.'
  - People think thieves move fast. Wrong. They move quiet.
  - Listen carefully.
  - To steal, pinch the item with your left hand.
  - Hold it for three seconds. Don't rush. If you let go too early, it doesn't count.
  - Out there, people watch. If someone sees you, the job fails.
  - 'Rule one:stay out of sight.

    Rule two:don''t get greedy.'
  - Go to the street and try it for yourself. Steal one item. Then come back.
  stage1Lines: []
  clickCooldown: 0.35
